! STEOM-CCSD def2-SVP def2-SVP/C def2/J RIJCOSX TightSCF
# CANONICAL STEOM-CCSD (no DLPNO) on the bare anion -> bounds the DLPNO error
# (compare to steom_bare.inp = DLPNO-STEOM). Feasible at 326 BF / 31 atoms gas-phase.
%maxcore 9000
%pal nprocs 8 end
%mdci
  NRoots 5
  DoRootWise true
  MaxIter 200
end
* xyzfile -1 1 cr2_chromophore.xyz
